   "**Bundibugyo removes the vaccine playbook** — the direct effect is that the ring-vaccination strategy which contained Zaire outbreaks in Uganda and DR Congo cannot simply be copied; the compound consequence is that the response must be built from isolation, PPE, safe burial and contact tracing — labour-intensive, and dependent on staff who have never run an Ebola response, in a country exercising its protocols for the first time in earnest",
