   "**A border is a bus route, not a firewall** — 9,500 cases and more than 4,000 deaths in DR Congo; the direct effect of a QR-coded form is a record; the compound consequence is that screening at a land crossing depends on staffing, power and honesty, and a symptomatic traveller who does not wish to be stopped will not complete a form — the ten-country watch list describes the routes, it does not close them",
