   "**The hinge is whether the next fortnight is funded like an emergency** — the moment contact tracing is staffed to completeness rather than to availability, with paid tracers and a published denominator; the moment isolation units have PPE, power and separate staff rotas, and health workers are enrolled under trial protocols where a candidate exists; the moment the DR Congo outbreak is funded as the source rather than treated as a neighbour's problem; and the moment cross-border screening is resourced at land crossings and not only at airports — the chain can be broken. §3 puts the duty in the simplest possible terms, and it is not a metaphor."
